1152:source\asw/mp3.c **** /**
1153:source\asw/mp3.c ****  * \brief Scan the whole card from the root and store all WAV files in MP3__songList.
1154:source\asw/mp3.c ****  *
1155:source\asw/mp3.c ****  * Stores the full path of each WAV file, e.g. "\MUSIC\SONG.WAV". Entries
1156:source\asw/mp3.c ****  * starting with '.', hidden and system entries are skipped. The scan stops when
1157:source\asw/mp3.c ****  * the list is full. Subfolders are scanned down to MP3__SCAN_MAX_DEPTH levels.
1158:source\asw/mp3.c ****  *
1159:source\asw/mp3.c ****  * It is a loop with an explicit level counter instead of a recursive function
1160:source\asw/mp3.c ****  * (N6). The parent folder is closed while a subfolder is
1161:source\asw/mp3.c ****  * scanned and opened again afterwards, skipping what was already read (N6).
1162:source\asw/mp3.c ****  *
1163:source\asw/mp3.c ****  * \return RC_SUCCESS when every folder could be opened (also with 0 songs found),
1164:source\asw/mp3.c ****  *         RC_ERROR_OPEN when a folder could not be opened or reopened, the list may be
1165:source\asw/mp3.c ****  *         incomplete (UART line written, error flag set, N11)
